  <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Ampliar</span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Anverso (arriba) y reverso (abajo) — Colección de Notofilia.com</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          \n          <div style=\"margin-top:44px;\"><h3 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Contexto</h3>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">Toda la serie fue impresa por Note Printing Australia y firmada por Wilson Kamit (Gobernador) y Simon Tosali (Secretario de Tesoro); el Ave del Paraíso, emblema del Escudo Nacional, y el Edificio del Parlamento Nacional de Port Moresby aparecen de forma recurrente en las distintas denominaciones, junto a artefactos culturales tradicionales de las diversas islas y tribus del país.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:36px;\"><h3 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Detalles Clave</h3>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Anverso:</strong> el Edificio del Parlamento Nacional en Port Moresby.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverso:</strong> un avión de pasajeros, un camión de minería, un barco de carga y una torre de telecomunicaciones, símbolos del desarrollo económico del país.</span></li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:44px; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 10px; font-style:normal;\">Notas</h3>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0;\">Referencias de catálogo, firmantes y fechas de emisión según el Standard Catalog of World Paper Money (Pick-28, 29, 30, 33 y 41) y el Bank of Papua New Guinea; el Ave del Paraíso (<em>Paradisaea raggiana</em>) es el ave nacional y emblema central del Escudo de Armas del país desde su independencia en 1975.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n    <div role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Billete ampliado\" data-zoom-dialog=\"note-1\" hidden class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n      <button data-zoom-close aria-label=\"Cerrar\" style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\">&times;</button>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n        <button disabled=\"true\" aria-label=\"Alejar\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&minus;</button>\n        <span style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n        <button disabled=\"false\" aria-label=\"Acercar\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&#43;</button>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; touch-action:none;\">\n        <picture><source srcset=\"/uploads/png-bank-2-kina-2007-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" /><img src=\"/uploads/png-bank-2-kina-2007-polimero.jpg\" alt=\"2 Kina, vista ampliada\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"display:block; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\" /></picture>\n        <picture><source srcset=\"/uploads/png-bank-5-kina-2007-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" /><img src=\"/uploads/png-bank-5-kina-2007-polimero.jpg\" alt=\"5 Kina, vista ampliada\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"display:block; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\" /></picture>\n        <picture><source srcset=\"/uploads/png-bank-10-kina-2007-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" /><img src=\"/uploads/png-bank-10-kina-2007-polimero.jpg\" alt=\"10 Kina, vista ampliada\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"display:block; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\" /></picture>\n        <picture><source srcset=\"/uploads/png-bank-50-kina-2005-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" /><img src=\"/uploads/png-bank-50-kina-2005-polimero.jpg\" alt=\"50 Kina, vista ampliada\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"display:block; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\" /></picture>\n        <picture><source srcset=\"/uploads/png-bank-100-kina-2005-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" /><img src=\"/uploads/png-bank-100-kina-2005-polimero.jpg\" alt=\"100 Kina, vista ampliada\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"display:block; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\" /></picture>\n      </div>\n      <span style=\"margin-top:18px; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic;\">Arrastra para mover &middot; Rueda del ratón para ampliar</span>\n    </div>\n  \n\n  \n\n</div>",
